{"unit":4,"items":17,"pass":12,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 4","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 4 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>This, that and the time</h2>\n      <p>Seventeen questions on Lessons 10&ndash;12: <i>this/that</i>, the time, days and dates. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>12 out of 17</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u4\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar and vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;12</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Choose the correct answer.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">___ pen here is red.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">That</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">These</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">This</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">___ cars there are big.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">That</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Those</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">These</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">What ___ these?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">am</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">are</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">is</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">The film is ___ eight o'clock.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">at</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">on</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">in</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">I get up ___ the morning.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">on</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">at</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">in</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">She works ___ night.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">on</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">at</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">in</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">7:30 = half ___ seven\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">and</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">to</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">past</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">My birthday is ___ July.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">in</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">at</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">on</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">The party is ___ Saturday.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">at</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">in</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">on</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">It's the ___ of May. (3)\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">third</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">three</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">threeth</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\">Monday, Tuesday, ___ , Thursday\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Friday</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Wednesday</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Sunday</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\">December is the last ___ of the year.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">month</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">day</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">date</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Write the answer &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 13&ndash;17</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Type your answer. Spelling counts; capital letters and full stops do not. &middot; В письменных ответах важна орфография; заглавные буквы и точки &mdash; нет.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">Ask the time.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"What time is it?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">Write 3:00: It's …<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"It's three o'clock.|three o'clock\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">Fix the mistake: The class is in Friday.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"The class is on Friday.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">Ask the date.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"What's the date today?|What is the date today?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">Fix the mistake: What is those?<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"What are those?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}